== North West ==

[[File:North West in South Africa.svg|right|150px]]

In May 2013 North West province premier [[Thandi Modise]] said the province needed to be renamed and not just be referred to as a "direction on a compass".<ref>[http://www.news24.com/SouthAfrica/News/Premier-North-West-needs-name-change-20130523 News24 North West name change] Retrieved 8/9/2013</ref> One of the suggestions has been to rename North West after politician and activist [[Moses Kotane]]. There is, however, [[Moses Kotane Local Municipality|already a municipality]] in the province named after him.

